    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d923">

                <pb facs="0745" n="669" xml:id="pg669"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7732</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Special Representative Rodgers
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-01T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 1, 1916, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Recent reports from Sonora indicate Yaquis again menacing life and property.
                    Special reference to section La Colorada to Mazatan and San Javier. Request
                    stationing of garrisons Yaqui territory sufficient to afford security against
                    sudden raids.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
